  bestiary:
  - enemy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 824754529e64539a08f93ce5ea6b9028, type: 2}
    boss: {fileID: 0}
    tier: 0
    blurb: Starved, chained and thrown in first. Alone they're nothing; they never come alone.
  - enemy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 51fd6705a6918542c8a48f6531e10146, type: 2}
    boss: {fileID: 0}
    tier: 0
    blurb: A half-wild dog the pit masters keep hungry. It circles, then leaps for your throat.
  - enemy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 729da0abfb08161378f0ed030335efd6, type: 2}
    boss: {fileID: 0}
    tier: 0
    blurb: Hides behind a door torn off its hinges. Hit him from the side or from behind.
  - enemy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 677af5aa554d6225685c50de3950805f, type: 2}
    boss: {fileID: 0}
    tier: 0
    blurb: Keeps his distance and pelts you with stones. Close the gap.
  - enemy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dadc94099a6e8005494fa3c710e62faf, type: 2}
    boss: {fileID: 0}
    tier: 0
    blurb: Twice your size and slow to fall. When he winds up, get out of the way.
  - enemy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 45a98fc17f9762fc4873616e13196ccf, type: 2}
    boss: {fileID: 0}
    tier: 0
    blurb: Lobs burning pots that set the sand alight. Don't stand where they land.
  - enemy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7fa2501fb2c6dc3b3bd5b5513e6d7b2b, type: 2}
    boss: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a371ea03d5b6dfdc58859b5691e51df4, type: 2}
    tier: 0
    blurb: The Pit Master. A flail, a whip, guards on call, and a ring of fire for whoever lasts.
  - enemy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 48e7ab87ef6d1dcc493c937e44e6fcd9, type: 2}
    boss: {fileID: 0}
    tier: 1
    blurb: Plants a pavise and looses arrows over it. Strike while he reloads.
  - enemy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 977754d8957140798a734032f2047210, type: 2}
    boss: {fileID: 0}
    tier: 1
    blurb: Flanks you where you aren't looking and dashes down a line. Watch the lane.
  - enemy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a1fd40a55ef7c1818ae59788a7dab6f8, type: 2}
    boss: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fd512218ec0bb2f9fb7394d81bf0d1a8, type: 2}
    tier: 1
    blurb: 'The Provinces'' pride: a fortress shield that wrecks barricades. Make him charge the stone.'
  - enemy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f75b026767da750658e1af940ba3a900, type: 2}
    boss: {fileID: 0}
    tier: 2
    blurb: 'A door-sized scutum and a fish-crested helm. Nothing gets through his front: go round him.'
  - enemy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ba865ce856e5061ca3c512ad66f5591, type: 2}
    boss: {fileID: 0}
    tier: 2
    blurb: 'Whirls a weighted net and throws it where you stand. Keep moving, or jump: it can''t catch you in the air.'
  - enemy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7a69919d6b8043dd4a69cc2e7f6e2e4b, type: 2}
    boss: {fileID: 0}
    tier: 2
    blurb: 'Bred in the pens to charge. It runs over anything in its lane, its own side included: lead it through the horde.'
  - enemy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9469a9b236dda0fe692d1f036aad6f3d, type: 2}
    boss: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 28be384594f4d0b1f8a414a87ffed25a, type: 2}
    tier: 2
    blurb: Master of the pens, more beast than man. He leaps on you from anywhere and his horn opens the cages.
